1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:08,307
The brain, about one point three five kilograms, floating in cerebrospinal fluid inside three meninges.

2
00:00:08,307 --> 00:00:11,888
The cerebrum thinks, remembers and moves you.

3
00:00:11,888 --> 00:00:14,882
The thalamus relays the senses.

4
00:00:14,882 --> 00:00:20,898
The hypothalamus controls temperature, hunger and thirst, and the pituitary.

5
00:00:20,898 --> 00:00:23,450
The cerebellum keeps balance.

6
00:00:23,450 --> 00:00:29,023
And the medulla runs the vital centres: heartbeat, breathing and blood pressure.

